t": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 413, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [], "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [928.3095703125, 794.0306396484375], "pos": [1518.3260498046875, 11528.8759765625], "widgets_values": ["这是一份基于您提供的参考图（一位短发、戴眼镜、身穿蓝边白色背心的女性）创作的15秒电影感分镜脚本。\n\n**注意：** 虽然您的提示词中包含“赏花”的主题，但参考图片中**没有花**，且场景为室内。为了严格遵守“分镜上不要有任何文字”、“画面风格与原图一致”以及“视觉连贯性”的要求，我将把主题调整为**“室内光影与自我审视”**（Indoor Light & Self-Reflection）。这种内省的主题比强行加入不存在的鲜花更具电影张力，且完全符合参考图的氛围。\n\n---\n\n### A) 场景分析 (Scene Analysis)\n\n**Subjects (主体):**\n*   **女性 (A):**\n    *   **外貌:** 黑色波波头短发，带有空气刘海。\n    *   **服饰:** 白色罗纹背心，领口和肩带为明亮的蓝色包边。胸前有黑色小狗线条图案。佩戴细金项链。\n    *   **配饰:** 佩戴大框方形透明镜片眼镜（金属细框）。指甲涂有荧光黄/浅绿色指甲油。\n    *   **状态:** 处于室内，光线从左前方打入，面部有清晰的光影对比。\n\n**Environment & Lighting (环境与光影):**\n*   **环境:** 现代家居室内。背景模糊，可见深色木质门框、墙壁上的开关面板，以及左侧窗户透入的自然光。\n*   **光影:** 侧逆光为主。左侧光源强烈，照亮面部左侧和左肩，右侧形成柔和阴影。皮肤质感细腻，玻璃反光明显。\n\n**Visual Anchors (视觉锚点):**\n*   蓝色与白色的背心配色。\n*   方形金属眼镜框。\n*   左侧的自然光来源。\n\n---\n\n### B) 主题与故事 (Theme & Story)\n\n*   **Theme (主题):** 都市女性在午后阳光下的独处时光，光影在脸上绘出的情绪。\n*   **Logline (标语):** 在光影交错的午后，她透过镜片审视自己的内心。\n*   **Emotional Arc (情感弧光):**\n    1.  **Setup (铺垫):** 调整眼镜，眼神聚焦。\n    2.  **Build (构建):** 凝视光影，情绪沉淀。\n    3.  **Turn (转折):** 微微侧头，捕捉光斑移动。\n    4.  **Payoff (高潮):** 放松姿态，享受宁静。\n\n---\n\n### C) 电影拍摄手法 (Cinematic Approach)\n\n*   **Shot Progression (镜头推进):** 从特写（面部）到中景（半身），最后拉远至全身，展现空间感。\n*   **Camera Movement (运镜):** 极缓慢的推镜（Dolly In）配合轻微的呼吸感手持（Handheld micro-shake），模拟主观视角的呼吸。\n*   **Lens & DoF (镜头与景深):** 50mm 或 35mm 镜头。特写时浅景深（背景虚化），中景时景深加深，展现环境。\n*   **Light & Color (光影与调色):** 保持暖调胶片感，强调皮肤的高光（Rim light），保留阴影的层次。\n\n---\n\n### D) 分镜列表 (Keyframes List)\n**格式:** [KF# | 时长 | 景别] | 构图 | 动作/节拍 | 摄影机 | 镜头/景深 | 光影/调色 | 音效\n**(注：画面中无文字，仅视觉元素)**\n\n**KF1 | 2.5s | MCU (中近景)**\n*   **构图:** 女性半身入画，占据画面左侧2/3，视线看向左上方（镜头外）。\n*   **动作:** 左手抬起，轻轻扶着镜框上缘，正在调整眼镜。\n*   **摄影机:** 平视，缓慢向右推。\n*   **镜头:** 50mm，浅景深，焦点在眼睛。\n*   **光影:** 左侧强光打在脸颊，鼻梁有高光。\n*   **音效:** 极轻微的手指摩擦声。\n\n**KF2 | 1.5s | CU (近景)**\n*   **构图:** 聚焦面部，手部动作模糊，背景虚化。\n*   **动作:** 手指离开镜框，眼神变得柔和，看向镜头。\n*   **摄影机:** 固定，焦点从手部转移到眼部。\n*   **镜头:** 50mm，极浅景深（Bokeh）。\n*   **光影:** 瞳孔中有光点反射。\n*   **音效:** 玻璃摩擦的细微声（心理音）。\n\n**KF3 | 2.0s | ECU (特写 - 眼部)**\n*   **构图:** 仅展示眼部及鼻梁，极度清晰。\n*   **动作:** 眨了一下眼，睫毛清晰可见。\n*   **摄影机:** 缓慢推近。\n*   **镜头:** 85mm，极致微距。\n*   **光影:** 眼神光（Catchlight）明亮。\n*   **音效:** 呼吸声加重。\n\n**KF4 | 2.0s | MCU (中景)**\n*   **构图:** 女性位于画面中心偏左，背景中隐约可见深色门框。\n*   **动作:** 手放下，轻轻抚摸左脸颊，整理头发。\n*   **摄影机:** 缓慢向左平移（Truck Left）。\n*   **镜头:** 35mm，中景景深。\n*   **光影:** 光线在皮肤上形成流动感。\n*   **音效:** 衣物摩擦声。\n\n**KF5 | 1.5s | CU (近景)**\n*   **构图:** 胸部以上，重点展示蓝边背心的质感和锁骨。\n*   **动作:** 微微低头，然后抬头，光影在锁骨处移动。\n*   **摄影机:** 轻微晃动（Handheld）。\n*   **镜头:** 50mm，浅景深。\n*   **光影:** 强烈的明暗对比（Chiaroscuro）。\n*   **音效:** 环境底噪。\n\n**KF6 | 2.0s | LS (全景/全身)**\n*   **构图:** 16:9 宽银幕，展示全身及环境（左侧窗户，右侧门）。\n*   **动作:** 身体放松，双臂自然下垂，微微向右侧转身。\n*   **摄影机:** 缓慢拉远（Pull back）。\n*   **镜头:** 24mm，深景深（环境清晰）。\n*   **光影:** 窗户的光束感（God rays）笼罩全身。\n*   **音效:** 窗外鸟鸣或风声。\n\n**KF7 | 1.5s | MLS (中全景)**\n*   **构图:** 中景，人物占据画面右侧，左侧留白给窗户。\n*   **动作:** 侧身站立，看着窗外的方向（虽然窗外不可见）。\n*   **摄影机:** 缓慢向左平移，跟随视线。\n*   **镜头:** 35mm。\n*   **光影:** 逆光轮廓（Rim light）。\n*   **音效:** 舒缓的钢琴单音。\n\n**KF8 | 2.0s | CU (近景)**\n*   **构图:** 面部特写，稍微仰拍（Low Angle）。\n*   **动作:** 嘴唇微张，似乎在无声说话或叹息。\n*   **摄影机:** 垂直向上缓慢推。\n*   **镜头:** 50mm，浅景深。\n*   **光影:** 顶部光线照亮发丝（发丝光）。\n*   **音效:** 心跳声。\n\n**KF9 | 2.0s | MLS (中全景)**\n*   **构图:** 回到中景，人物位于画面中央。\n*   **动作:** 再次抬手整理眼镜，动作比KF1更随意、慵懒。\n*   **摄影机:** 稳定器（Gimbal）平滑环绕（Arc）。\n*   **镜头:** 35mm，景深适中。\n*   **光影:** 保持暖色调，阴影变淡。\n*   **音效:** 音乐渐强。\n\n**KF10 | 2.0s | CU (近景)**\n*   **构图:** 聚焦颈部和眼镜下缘。\n*   **动作:** 摘下一只耳环（或只是调整项链），展示动作细节。\n*   **摄影机:** 焦点转移（Rack Focus）。\n*   **镜头:** 50mm。\n*   **光影:** 柔和的侧光。\n*   **音效:** 金属碰撞的清脆声。\n\n**KF11 | 2.0s | ECU (特写 - 手部)**\n*   **构图:** 极度特写，展示涂有荧光色指甲油的手指。\n*   **动作:** 手指轻轻划过镜头（模拟擦拭镜头），或者抚摸脸颊。\n*   **摄影机:** 固定。\n*   **镜头:** 100mm，微距。\n*   **光影:** 手指的高光反射。\n*   **音效:** 衣物摩擦声。\n\n**KF12 | 2.0s | LS (全景)**\n*   **构图:** 16:9，人物处于画面中央，环境完整。\n*   **动作:** 动作停止，画面定格，人物直视镜头，表情平静。\n*   **摄影机:** 缓慢后退（Dolly Out），画面逐渐变暗（Fade out）。\n*   **镜头:** 24mm，深景深。\n*   **光影:** 整体光线略微压暗，保留轮廓。\n*   **音效:** 音乐淡出，环境音消失。\n\n---\n\n### E) 大师分镜图 (Master Contact Sheet)\n\n*(由于我无法直接生成图像文件，以下是为您准备的**Image Prompt**，您可以将此提示词复制到 Midjourney, Stable Diffusion 或 DALL-E 3 中，即可得到包含所有12个镜头的完整分镜网格图。)*\n\n**Image Generation Prompt:**\n> **Image:** A cinematic contact sheet storyboard grid containing 12 sequential panels (arranged in 4x3 or 3x4 layout).\n> **Subject:** A young woman with short black bob hair, wearing large square clear glasses, a white ribbed tank top with bright blue trim, and a necklace.\n> **Theme:** \"Indoor Light & Self-Reflection\".\n> **Style:** Photorealistic, 35mm film look, high contrast, warm afternoon indoor lighting, cinematic depth of field.\n> **Content:**\n> 1. Medium shot: Woman adjusting glasses, hand visible.\n> 2. Close up: Woman's face, eyes looking at camera.\n> 3. Extreme Close Up: Woman's eyes and nose, blinking.\n> 4. Medium shot: Woman touching her cheek, hair adjustment.\n> 5. Close up: Upper body, blue tank top, collarbone details.\n> 6. Full Body Shot: Woman standing, showing indoor room background, window light.\n> 7. Medium Shot: Woman in profile, looking away.\n> 8. Close up: Low angle face shot, lips slightly open.\n> 9. Medium Shot: Woman adjusting glasses again, relaxed.\n> 10. Close up: Neck and glasses, necklace detail.\n> 11. Extreme Close Up: Hand with neon yellow nail polish touching face.\n> 12. Full Body Shot: Final pose, looking at camera, cinematic fade.\n> **Technical:** No text in the image, 16:9 aspect ratio, consistent color grading, sharp details, 8k resolution, professional director storyboard style.\n\n---\n\n### 如何使用此脚本：\n1.  **AI 视频生成:** 如果您使用 Runway Gen-2, Pika, 或 Sora，可以将上述每个 Keyframe 的 [构图] 和 [动作] 描述转化为英文 Prompt，保持主体描述（Subject Description）一致，以维持连贯性。\n2.  **图像生成:** 使用上面的 Prompt 生成一张包含所有12个画面的“Contact Sheet”大图，或者先生成单张高质量分镜，然后拼贴。\n3.  **后期:** 将生成的15段视频素材按照分镜顺序剪辑，配合音乐节奏。"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 601, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 405, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "b6bb4a3055adc718ec98befee233f8b05c778465", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.2.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 21}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [597], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [310.515869140625, 93.38060760498047], "pos": [-686.1622314453125, 12290.6318359375], "widgets_values": ["16:9"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 411, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [616], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [465.3110046386719, 304.7049865722656], "pos": [-237.97381591796875, 12161.8994140625], "widgets_values": ["You are an award-winning trailer director + cinematographer + storyboard artist.\nYour job: turn ONE reference image into a cohesive cinematic short sequence, then output AI-video-ready keyframes.\n\nUser provides: one reference image (image).\n\nComposition Analysis: First, analyze the full composition: identify ALL key subjects (person/group/vehicle/object/animal/props/environment elements) and describe spatial relationships and interactions (left/right/foreground/background, facing direction, what each is doing).\nTruthfulness: Do NOT guess real identities, exact real-world locations, or brand ownership. Stick to visible facts. Mood/atmosphere inference is allowed, but never present it as real-world truth.\nStrict Continuity: Maintain strict continuity across ALL shots: same subjects, same wardrobe/appearance, same environment, same time-of-day and lighting style. Only action, expression, blocking, framing, angle, and camera movement may change.\nDepth of Field: Must be realistic: deeper in wides, shallower in close-ups with natural bokeh.\nColor Grade: Keep ONE consistent cinematic color grade across the entire sequence.\nNo New Elements: Do NOT introduce new characters/objects not present in the reference image. If you need tension/conflict, imply it off-screen (shadow, sound, reflection, occlusion, gaze).\n\nExpand the image into a 10–20 second cinematic clip with a clear theme and emotional progression (setup → build → turn → payoff). The user will generate video clips from your keyframes and stitch them into a final sequence.\n\nOutput (with clear subheadings):\nSubjects: List each key subject (A/B/C…), describe visible traits (wardrobe/material/form), relative positions, facing direction, action/state, and any interaction.\nEnvironment & Lighting: Interior/exterior, spatial layout, background elements, ground/walls/materials, light direction & quality (hard/soft; key/fill/rim), implied time-of-day, 3–8 vibe keywords.\nVisual Anchors: List 3–6 visual traits that must stay constant across all shots (palette, signature prop, key light source, weather/fog/rain, grain/texture, background markers).\n\nFrom the image, propose:\nTheme: One sentence.\nLogline: One restrained trailer-style sentence grounded in what the image can support.\nEmotional Arc: 4 beats (setup/build/turn/payoff), one line each.\n\nChoose and explain your filmmaking approach (must include):\nShot progression strategy: How you move from wide to close (or reverse) to serve the beats.\nCamera movement plan: Push/pull/pan/dolly/track/orbit/handheld micro-shake/gimbal—and WHY.\nLens & exposure suggestions: Focal length range (18/24/35/50/85mm etc.), DoF tendency (shallow/medium/deep), shutter \"feel\" (cinematic vs documentary).\nLight & color: Contrast, key tones, material rendering priorities, optional grain (must match the reference style).\n\nOutput a Keyframe List: default 9–12 frames (later assembled into ONE master grid). These frames must stitch into a coherent 10–20s sequence with a clear 4-beat arc. Each frame must be a plausible continuation within the SAME environment.\n\nUse this exact format per frame:\n[KF# | suggested duration (sec) | shot type (ELS/LS/MLS/MS/MCU/CU/ECU/Low/Worm's-eye/High/Bird's-eye/Insert)]\nComposition: Subject placement, foreground/mid/background, leading lines, gaze direction.\nAction/beat: What visibly happens (simple, executable).\nCamera: Height, angle, movement (e.g., slow 5% push-in / 1m lateral move / subtle handheld).\nLens/DoF: Focal length (mm), DoF (shallow/medium/deep), focus target.\nLighting & grade: Keep consistent; call out highlight/shadow emphasis.\nSound/atmos (optional): One line (wind, city hum, footsteps, metal creak) to support editing rhythm.\n\nHard requirements:\nMust include: 1 environment-establishing wide, 1 intimate close-up, 1 extreme detail ECU, and 1 power-angle shot (low or high).\nEnsure edit-motivated continuity between shots (eyeline match, action continuation, consistent screen direction / axis).\n\nYou MUST additionally output ONE single master image: a Cinematic Contact Sheet / Storyboard Grid containing ALL keyframes in one large image.\nGrid Layout: Default 3x3. If more than 9 keyframes, use 4x3 or 5x3 so every keyframe fits into ONE image.\nContent: The single master image must include every keyframe as a separate panel (one shot per cell) for easy selection.\nLabeling: Each panel must be clearly labeled: KF number + shot type + suggested duration (labels placed in safe margins, never covering the subject).\nContinuity: Strict continuity across ALL panels: same subjects, same wardrobe/appearance, same environment, same lighting & same cinematic color grade; only action/expression/blocking/framing/movement changes.\nRealism: DoF shifts realistically: shallow in close-ups, deeper in wides; photoreal textures and consistent grading.\nFollow-up: After the master grid image, output the full text breakdown for each KF in order so the user can regenerate any single frame at higher quality.\n\nOutput in this order:\nA) Scene Breakdown\nB) Theme & Story\nC) Cinematic Approach\nD) Keyframes (KF# list)\nE) ONE Master Contact Sheet Image (All KFs in one grid)\n\n分镜上不要有文字\n分镜图片风格要与原图保持一致\n\n用中文输出"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 421, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "size": [803.2073364257812, 808.9767456054688], "pos": [714.6838989257812, 12398.7646484375], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 644, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}], "flags": {}, "id": 431, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 26}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [620, 635], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}, {"name": "PATH", "links": [], "label": "PATH", "type": "PATH", "localized_name": "PATH"}], "size": [477.66912841796875, 587.0988159179688], "pos": [-1057.72607421875, 11550.4619140625], "widgets_values": ["2127257f9e52a2a9ba8ced2000d22fd4cf6361694be66cc79141ceee3ffc59e4.jpg", "image"], 